  "prompt": "How much MRR churned in each month of 2024 and 2025 (event_date from 1 January 2024 to 31 December 2025)? Add up the churn events' mrr_delta_local and report the loss as a positive amount in euros, rounded to 2 decimals with ROUND. Convert every amount to euros at one fixed rate, that of 31 December 2025: multiply by fx_rates.eur_per_unit for the subscription's currency on 2025-12-31. Count an event in the month of its event_date. Return two columns, in this order: month_start (the first day of the month) and churned_mrr. Return one row for each month with churn. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "month_start",
        "type_class": "temporal"
      },
